Charmaine is currently 16 - 12 = 4 years old.

Four years from now, she will be 4 + 4 = 8 years old.

\boxed{8}

First, we need to determine the number of hash browns made per potato. If 6 potatoes yield 36 hash browns, then each potato makes 36/6 = 6 hash browns.

Now, if we have 96 potatoes, and each potato makes 6 hash browns, then we can make 96 * 6 = 576 hash browns.

\boxed{576}
